+
+For bounded read-only CrowdWorks listing/detail observations on the already selected strict target, require `crowdworks-inspection-v1` and send `{"argv":["crowdworks-inspect"]}` through the private wrapper. It returns canonical job links, own projected labels and card/page text with complete main/light-DOM coverage or a fixed unsupported/overflow error. `cw_*` IDs are observations, never action refs. No raw DOM/title/page URL, editable values, tab selection, focus, renderer wake, or retry is added. Mock coverage is not real-site equivalence. See the bridge reference for the exact schema, bounds and unsupported cases.
